{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"jfj-e-o054b","title":"姜维奉刘禅敕令降钟会将士砍石","order":7837,"accounts":[{"id":"jfj-a-o054b","label":"正文 · 景耀六年","text":"姜维奉刘禅敕令降钟会将士砍石","evidence":["jfj-q0200"]},{"id":"wgc-a-6-e20","label":"正文","text":"姜维至郪县放仗送节传诣会降","evidence":["wgc-q0474","wgc-q0077"]},{"id":"wgc-a-7-e5","label":"正文","text":"姜维等解甲投戈面缚委质","evidence":["wgc-q0479","wgc-q0078"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0050","role":"奉敕投降","evidence":["jfj-q0200"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0112","role":"下敕","evidence":["jfj-q0200"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"受降","evidence":["jfj-q0200"]},{"person":"jfj-p0029","role":"收节传","evidence":["wgc-q0474","wgc-q0077"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"景耀六年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条保留原时间；未从邻段自动继承公元年。","evidence":["jfj-q0200","jfj-q0028","jfj-q0029"],"year":263,"chronology":"jfj-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"jfj-q0028","basis":"本条行动与所列正文纪年逐项核对；现代注释直接释年。原季月保留，不推公历日。"}},"ordering_evidence":"jfj-q0200"}],"persons":[{"id":"jfj-p0029","name":"胡烈","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0050","name":"姜维","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0112","name":"刘禅","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0028","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-6e2f890762325a17fefa","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖1〗，维表后主：“闻钟会治兵关中，欲规进取；宜并遣张翼、廖化督诸军，分护阳安关口、阴平桥头，以防未然〖2〗。”皓征信鬼巫〖3〗，谓敌终不自致；启后主寝其事〖4〗，而群臣不知。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0029","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-244c42d136c1fc518809","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-07b5919ab8c7edcb2376","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0200","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-f9ccb328eaad39645f39","layer":"original","quote":"寻被后主敕令，乃投戈放甲，诣会于涪军前；将士咸怒，拔刀砍石。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0077","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"艾遂至绵竹，大战，斩诸葛瞻。维等闻瞻已破，率其众东入于巴〖3〗。会乃进军至涪，遣胡烈、田续、庞会等追维〖4〗。艾进军向成都；刘禅诣艾降，遣使敕维等令降于会。维至广汉郪县〖5〗，令兵悉放器仗，送节、传于胡烈〖6〗，便从东道诣会降。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0078","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6a383cd03d18c26da31d","layer":"original","quote":"会上言曰：“贼姜维、张翼、廖化、董厥等〖7〗，逃死遁走，欲趋成都。臣辄遣司马夏侯咸、护军胡烈等，经从剑阁，出新都、大渡截其前〖8〗；参军爰g 、将军句安等蹑其后；参军皇甫闿、将军王买等从涪南出冲其腹；臣据涪县为东西势援。维等所统步骑四五万人，擐甲厉兵〖9〗，塞川填谷，数百里中首尾相继；凭恃其众，方轨而西。臣敕咸、闿等，令分兵据势，广张罗网；南杜走吴之道，西塞成都之路，北绝越逸之径；四面云集，首尾并进，蹊路断绝，走伏无地。臣又手书申喻，开示生路；群寇困逼，知命穷数尽；解甲投戈，面缚委质；印绶万数，资器山积。昔舜舞干戚，有苗自服；牧野之师〖10〗，商旅倒戈〖11〗。有征无战，帝王之盛业。‘全国为上，破国次之；全军为上，破军次之’：用兵之令典〖12〗。陛下圣德，侔踪前代；翼辅忠明〖13〗，齐轨公旦〖14〗；‘仁育群生，义征不h〖15〗’；殊俗向化，无思不服；师不逾时，兵不血刃；万里同风，九州共贯。臣辄奉宣诏命，导扬恩化；复其社稷，安其闾伍；舍其赋调，弛其征役；训之德礼以移其风，示之轨仪以易其俗。百姓欣欣，人怀逸豫〖16〗；后来其苏〖17〗，义无以过。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":532,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":480,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0474","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"维至广汉郪县〖5〗，令兵悉放器仗，送节、传于胡烈〖6〗，便从东道诣会降","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":78,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0479","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6a383cd03d18c26da31d","layer":"original","quote":"群寇困逼，知命穷数尽；解甲投戈，面缚委质；印绶万数，资器山积","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":532,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":224,"end":254,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
